        "You could call Voss and tell her the tape exists, or that it does not, or that you sold her in a room with a cracked screen. You could call her and lie again. You could eat the night and let morning be the clinic's problem. The rain decides your hair. Neon runs. A man two platforms over laughs too loudly, the same species of laugh as the first night Kane's card was still a rumor.\n\nYou are burned to a director. You may be a double. You may be a person who said no with your whole mouth and will pay in Sundays. You may be a person who looked at a lens and invented yes. All of those people need to get on a tram. The tram, which does not love you, agrees to carry the problem as far as a rented slot. That is not mercy. That is a route.",
